% Scenario: ueofill fills a user path with the even-odd rule, so the
% self-intersecting star keeps its hollow centre; the second page is
% the same star filled even-odd by hand.
{0 0 100 100 setbbox 50 90 moveto 20 10 lineto 90 60 lineto 10 60 lineto 80 10 lineto closepath} ueofill
showpage
50 90 moveto 20 10 lineto 90 60 lineto 10 60 lineto 80 10 lineto closepath eofill
showpage
